# The Tier-2 e2e seed is a binary controller volume snapshot (xz-compressed
# tar). It is committed (throwaway test controller) but is large, so track it
# via git-lfs to keep it out of the packed history. Requires `git lfs install`
# (one-time, per clone) before checkout pulls the real object — see
# test/e2e/README.md.
test/e2e/unifi-seed.tgz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
